  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n3(6)/(7) - left{ {5(1)/(7) - ( {2(3)/(7) - 3overline {(5)/(7) - 4} } )} right}\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 3(6)/(7) - left{ {5(1)/(7) - ( {2(3)/(7) - 3overline {(5)/(7) - 4} } )} right}=3(6)/(7) - left{ {5(1)/(7) - ( {2(3)/(7) - overline{(26)/(7) - 4} } )} right}\n\n⇒ 3(6)/(7) - left{ {5(1)/(7) - ( {2(3)/(7) - {(-2)/(7)} } )} right}\n\n⇒ 3(6)/(7) - left{ {5(1)/(7) - ( {(17)/(7) + {(2)/(7)} } )} right}=3(6)/(7) - left{ {5(1)/(7) - {(19)/(7) }} right}\n\n⇒ (27)/(7)-(36-19)/(7)=(27)/(7)-(17)/(7)\n\n⇒ (27-17)/(7)=(10)/(7)\n\n**Hence, the simplified value of the expression is (10)/(7)**",
